@orders = http://localhost:5830
@notifications = http://localhost:5831

### Keep this key to retry the same request. Use a new UUID for a new order.
POST {{orders}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 76e10fd9-642d-4101-a59f-ef46c2a915c0

{"email":"reader@example.com","total":42.50}

### Copy the returned order ID into these two URLs.
GET {{orders}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### May return 404 until the event has been consumed.
GET {{notifications}}/notifications/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### APIs stay alive when RabbitMQ stops; readiness checks each service's own database.
GET {{orders}}/health/ready

### Machine-readable API description
GET {{orders}}/openapi/v1.json
